# when 7 scells addition are successful in MSG:"RRC Reconfiguration" for Pscell Pdcch-config:tci-statesPDCCH-ToAddlist:16, tci-statesPDCCH-ToReleaselist: 32. Pdsch-config:tci-statesPDCCH-ToAddlist:32, tci-statesPDCCH-ToReleaselist: 64, csi-MeasConfig:nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToReleaseList: 32, nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToReleaseList: 16, csi-ResourceConfigtoAddModlist: 8, csi-ResourceConfigtoReleaselist:16
# 7DL 3UL Scell are added. for each scell Pdcch-config:tci-statesPDCCH-ToAddlist:16, Pdsch-config:tci-statesPDCCH-ToAddlist:32, csi-MeasConfig:NZP-CSI-RS-Resource:Id0:periodicityAndOffset is as same as pcell: slot320. csi-MeasConfig:csi-ResourceConfigToAddModList: 18, nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetToAddModList: 17, nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceToAddModList: 33. Pcell and 3 scells are configured with UL CA: sCellConfigDedicated.uplinkConfig.uplinkBWP-ToAddModList = 1.
